WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:03.856
For all the CEOs and founders who
are listening, on April 1st, we will

00:00:03.856 --> 00:00:09.510
start accepting applications for the 2023
class of the Seed Transformation Program.

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:12.468
The 11 month intensive program
will start in January, and

00:00:12.468 --> 00:00:16.770
it includes a combination of face to face
teaching, networking and virtual learning.

00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:21.598
You'll have the opportunity to participate
in a cohort of 60 other like minded

00:00:21.598 --> 00:00:24.087
entrepreneurs from across your region.

00:00:24.087 --> 00:00:27.476
Founders and CEOs of companies
based in Sub-Saharan Africa and

00:00:27.476 --> 00:00:32.960
South Asia, with annual revenue of at
least $300,000 are eligible to apply.

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:36.624
If you are a company,
you know may be interested,

00:00:36.624 --> 00:00:41.345
please visit Stanford seed.co
forward/apply to learn more.

00:00:41.345 --> 00:00:42.995
[MUSIC]

00:00:42.995 --> 00:00:45.139
&gt;&gt; There is a Japanese saying that,

00:00:45.139 --> 00:00:50.052
