the problems are, is itself a constraint.

00:00:56.350 --> 00:00:59.230
Every entrepreneur has to
wrestle with the unknown.

00:00:59.230 --> 00:01:02.852
The most successful ones develop a skill
set to help them deal with the things that

00:01:02.852 --> 00:01:04.490
they can't predict.

00:01:04.490 --> 00:01:09.686
Therefore, I think that if I had
known too much about banking,

00:01:09.686 --> 00:01:11.680
