the professional banker.

00:01:15.081 --> 00:01:19.868
I was just an MBA,
who just had that certain overconfidence,

00:01:19.868 --> 00:01:23.840
that MBAs have,
that any problem can be analyzed.

00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:26.880
Can be assessed as
a problem of management.

00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:31.640
The strategy can emanate from it,
and you should be able to execute.

