00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:14.924
Could you say a bit more worry about that?

00:07:14.924 --> 00:07:15.620
&gt;&gt; Yes.

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:21.113
The thing is that all of the arguments for
why a country can be successful,

00:07:21.113 --> 00:07:25.820
are the same arguments as to why
a country can be unsuccessful.

00:07:25.820 --> 00:07:30.740
So, for example, a large market It
can simply be 100 million people

00:07:30.740 --> 00:07:34.840
who have very little income,
very little spending power,

00:07:34.840 --> 00:07:39.104
it can simply mean that you have
a problem of overpopulation,

00:07:39.104 --> 00:07:43.287
you can't educate all the people
concerned on the one hand.

00:07:43.287 --> 00:07:48.168
On the other hand, it can also mean
that you have a wonderful market

00:07:48.168 --> 00:07:52.962
within which to test the products,
to perfect the products, and

00:07:52.962 --> 00:07:58.315
then to form the basis of going into
