00:15:30.414 --> 00:15:31.864
That was a pivotal moment for me.

00:15:31.864 --> 00:15:34.416
[LAUGH]
&gt;&gt; Because they knew headcount cuts

00:15:34.416 --> 00:15:35.062
were coming.

00:15:35.062 --> 00:15:36.949
&gt;&gt; They knew cuts were coming and

00:15:36.949 --> 00:15:41.557
